    "testCommand": "cd \"/c/Users/aaron/projects/Finance agent/mmm-app\" && git add -A 2>&1 | grep -v warning; git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfeat: Coach Phase B — weekly digest + proactive nudges\n\n- GET /api/money/digest: deterministic week-over-week summary (saved this\n  week, spending vs last week, net-worth delta from snapshots, emergency-fund\n  status, biggest category mover) + the top two findings. computeDigest() is\n  pure and vitest-covered (15 advice tests total).\n- On launch (once per session, after the hub is usable) the coach either pops\n  the weekly digest (at most once per calendar week, tracked via\n  coach.lastDigestWeek + isoWeek) OR — on other days — fires the top 1-2\n  findings as dismissible nudge toasts. If the digest shows it lists the same\n  findings, so the toasts are skipped to avoid piling on.\n- DigestModal: \"your week\" headline + stat grid + what-to-do-about-it.\n- Critical findings also raise a native OS notification (coach-notify IPC +\n  window.mmm.notify) so they reach you when MMM is minimized to the tray.\n- Settings → Coach section: proactive-nudges toggle, nudge level (Top 1-2 /\n  Critical only), weekly-digest toggle. All default ON.\n\nVerified in-app: digest modal renders with real week data, nudge toast fires\non the non-digest path, Settings toggles present.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1",
    "lintCommand": null,
    "devCommand": "npm run dev",
    "scripts": {
      "dev": "concurrently \"npm run dev:react\" \"npm run dev:electron\"",
      "dev:react": "vite src -c vite.config.mjs --port 5173",
      "dev:electron": "wait-on http://localhost:5173 && electron .",
      "build": "vite build src -c vite.config.mjs",
      "start": "electron .",
      "test": "vitest run",
      "test:watch": "vitest",
      "build:portable": "node scripts/build-portable.mjs",
      "package": "npm run build && electron-builder"
    }
